格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugin for MCP status inspection and server management | dsh 的 MCP状态查看与服务管理插件","id":"gh:1334328029","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-mcp-admin","slug":"kairoz9/dsh-mcp-admin","topics":["cordis","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","typert","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugin for MCP status inspection and server management | dsh 的 MCP状态查看与服务管理插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mcp-admin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A dsh (DeepSeek Harness) plugin: **Inspect MCP status** (`/mcp` command) + **Manage MCP servers in S"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ettings** (add / edit / delete / enable / disable, written back to `cordis.patch.yml`). MIT licensed"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ttings** (add / edit / delete / enable / disable, written back to `cordis.patch.yml`). MIT licensed."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`/mcp` command output:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Settings page \"MCP\" panel:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Release tarball** (Recommended, no build required): Download `dsh-mcp-admin-<version>.tgz` from Re"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"** (Recommended, no build required): Download `dsh-mcp-admin-<version>.tgz` from Releases, then run:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Build tarball locally** (if building yourself):"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Git repository** (installs from source via `prepare` build):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> pnpm ≥10 refuses to run the `prepare` script of git dependencies by default, which causes the init"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ial Git installation to fail. dsh will print the fix in the error message: add the package key to th"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"at profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and re-run `add`:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> It is recommended to pin a commit or tag: `github:kairoz9/dsh-mcp-admin#v0.2.0`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- `/mcp` — Lists MCP servers across all profiles + live tool count (including never-connected server"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"s, read from full config inventory).\n- Settings page \"MCP\" panel — Manage MCP servers per profile: a"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"dd / edit / disable / enable / delete, with status dots auto-refreshing every second. Saving writes "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"back to that profile's `cordis.patch.yml`, and dsh automatically hot-reloads (HMR)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Host-side `McpAdminRemote` (`TypertRemoteService`, `@Remote` methods) is auto-discovered by the host"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" gateway. The browser client self-mounts this namespace via `ctx.remote.$mount`, and both the panel "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"and `/mcp` popup read the same structured data:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- `list()` — Reads the full server inventory from the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`, then filters `mc"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"p__` prefix with `ctx.tools.schemas()` to annotate real-time tool counts; enumerates active `mcp-cli"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ent` instances from Cordis registry to distinguish \"connected / instance present with 0 tools (conne"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ction failed) / not loaded\".\n- `set()` — Reconciles and writes back to `cordis.patch.yml` (single at"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"omic write, comments preserved), and dsh's `watchUserPatches` HMR automatically reloads `mcp-client`"},{"id":"p20s6","text":".\n- `/mcp` command reads all profiles and outputs the tool list for each server."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
